ual-EPC setup (main and local).\n\nenb connects to main EPC. UE attaches, and pings - no issues \n\nmain EPC goes down( by issuing: docker compose -f 4g-volte-deploy.yaml down) enb connect to local epc. UE attaches and pings - no issues. \n\nmain epc is brought up(by issuing docker compose -f 4g-volte-deploy.yaml up) enb sends abort to local epc - enb connects to main EPC - UE attaches, ping fails.\n\nSo after failover recovery (when the main EPC comes back up), the UE reattaches successfully but ping fails — meaning attach works, but data path (user plane) is broken.\n\nattaching the EPC console flag (I am using latest docker_open5gs with latest open5gs (master)).\n\n[EPCpingIssue_203.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22969649/EPCpingIssue_203.txt)\n\nAnd the same test when repeated with other reference commercial EPC with same eNB, it is working fine.\n\nPlease let me know how I can fix this asap and also let me know if you need any other logs.\n\nThanks & Regards,\nAshok","closed_by":{"login":"ashokhs77","id":1695031,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTUwMzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1695031?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77","html_url":"https://github.com/ashokhs77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashokhs77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.co